Third-party components

This licence covers the code in this repository only. Running it requires
components distributed under their own terms, which are not granted here and
are in some cases more restrictive:

  * submodules/diff-gauss and submodules/diff-gaussian-rasterization derive
    from gaussian-splatting, licensed by Inria and the Max Planck Institut
    fuer Informatik for **non-commercial research and evaluation only**.
    Because DIMO renders through these rasterizers, that restriction applies
    in practice to the pipeline as a whole.
  * Wan2.2 and CogVideoX are Apache-2.0.
  * SV4D / SV3D code is MIT; their model weights are covered separately by the
    Stability AI Community Licence.
  * Model weights obtained from third parties (Wan2.2, CogVideoX, SV4D, BERT,
    u2net, RAFT) remain under the licences of their respective providers.

Check each component's licence before any commercial use.
